<title>ITALY: Italian bank IMI posts 1996 profit.</title>
<headline>Italian bank IMI posts 1996 profit.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian investment bank IMI SpA reported on Wednesday a net profit in 1996 of 370 billion lire, up nine percent from 1995.</p>
<p>An IMI statement said the bank would offer a higher dividend, 550 lire compared to 500 previously.</p>
</text>
